    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo abena Israeli balongene bonse pamo kuli Davidi ku Hebuloni no kutila, “Ifwe tuli munofu obe kabili umulopa obe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku nshita iyapita, nelyofye Saulo acili mfumu, niwe watungulwile Israeli mu nshita shabulwi. Kabili Yawe Lesa obe asosele kuli iwe ati, ‘Uli nokucema abantu bandi abena Israeli, kabili ukaba kateeka wabo.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo abakalamba bonse aba bena Israeli baisa ku Hebuloni, elyo Davidi apanga nabo icipangano ku Hebuloni pa cinso cakwa Yawe. Elyo basubile Davidi amafuta yakuba imfumu ya bena Israeli, ukulingana ne shiwi lyakwa Yawe ilyasoselwe muli Samwele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
