            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.23.8+2SA.23.9+2SA.23.10+2SA.23.11+2SA.23.12+2SA.23.13+2SA.23.14+2SA.23.15+2SA.23.16+2SA.23.17+2SA.23.18+2SA.23.19+2SA.23.20+2SA.23.21+2SA.23.22+2SA.23.23+2SA.23.24+2SA.23.25+2SA.23.26+2SA.23.27+2SA.23.28+2SA.23.29+2SA.23.30+2SA.23.31+2SA.23.32+2SA.23.33+2SA.23.34+2SA.23.35+2SA.23.36+2SA.23.37+2SA.23.38+2SA.23.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 23:8-39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba ebali abakalamba ba mpalume shabulwi shakwa Davidi abo akwete. Aba bene pamo na bena Israeli bonse abapeele icikoseleshi icikalamba ku bufumu bwakwe, no kulenga ubufumu bukumane mu calo conse nge shiwi Yawe alaile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi impalume shabulwi shakwa Davidi ni ishi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yashobeamu umwana wa mwina Hakimoni, ewali umukalamba uwalemona pa baletungulula abashilika, ewaimishe ifumo lyakwe mukulwisha abantu imyanda itatu (300), abo aipeye pa muku umofye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwamukonkelepo ni Eleasa umwana wakwa Dodo, umwina Ahoyi umo pa mpalume shabulwi shitatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali pamo na Davidi pa Pasi Damimu ilyo Abafilisiti balongene mukulwa. Pa ncende apali ibala umwaiswile bale epo abashilika bafulumwike ukufuma ku Bafilisiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo baya iminina mukati ke bala, balicingilila elyo baipaya na Bafilisiti, kabili Yawe abapeele ukucimfya ukukalamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batatu pa ba makumi yatatu (30) abaletungulula abashilika, batentemwike baisa ku cilibwe kuli Davidi ku lucengo lwa Adulamu. Elyo ibumba lya Bafilisiti lyalongene mwishika lya Refaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pali ilya nshita Davidi ali mwilinga elyo akamba ka bashilika ba Bafilisiti kali mu Betelemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi alefwaisha amenshi elyo alanda ati, “Iye, nga kuti umo andetelako amenshi yakunwa ukufuma ku cishima icaba mupepi ne mpongolo ya ku Betelemu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi balya batatu epakupula mu mipaka ya Bafilisiti, no kuya tapa amenshi ukufuma mu cishima icali pa mpongolo ya ku Betelemu, baleta na kuli Davidi. Lelo ena akaana ukuti anwe aya menshi. Mu cifulo cakunwa Davidi ayetila ukuba umutuulo pa cinso cakwa Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo asosa ati, “Lesa akaanye ukuti ine ncite ici cintu. Bushe kuti nanwa umulopa wa aba bantu uo bacishitikilapo ubumi bwabo?” Pantu bacishitika ubumi bwabo pakuya yaleta. Kanshi Davidi epakukana ukunwa. Ifi efyabombele ishi mpalume shabulwi shitatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abishai munyina kwa Yoabu ewali umukalamba pali ishi shitatu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ba Baibele bamo batila, “pali aba amakumi yatatu (30).”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Ewaimishe ifumo lyakwe pa balwani imyanda itatu (300), abepaya. Elyo aisa ba ne shina ilyalumbuka nga aba bene batatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apeelwe umucinshi imiku ibili ukucila pali aba batatu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:21",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ba Baibele bamo batila, “pali aba amakumi yatatu (30).”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kabili aisa ba umukalamba wabo, nangu cali ukuti tapendelwe pakati kabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
