          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaya umwana wakwa Yehoiyada umwina Kabiseli ali umwaume wine wine mukulwa, uwabombele ifintu ifingi nganshi. Aipeye amalamba ya baume babili abena Moabu. Kabili aya ingila mu cilindi, ninshi kuli na menshi makasa, aipayamo inkalamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo aipaya no mwina Egupto uwalepele bamita babili na citika",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:23",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu Cihibulu batila abati, “uwalepele amakubiti yasano.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Nangu umwina Egupto akwete ifumo mu minwe yakwe ilyali nge cimuti cakupikwilako insalu, Benaya amulungeme ne nkonto, apokolola ifumo ukufuma mu minwe ya mwina Egupto no kumwipaila kwifumo lyakwe line. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifi efyabombele Benaya mwana Yehoiyada. Nao wine ali no lulumbi nge mpalume shabulwi shitatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apeelwe umucinshi uukalamba nganshi ukucila na pa baume bene bene amakumi yatatu (30) abaletungulula abashilika, lelo tapendelwe pali shilya shitatu. Awe Davidi epakumubika ukuba kangalila wa bakumulinda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
